OL,3,GNEWSASheffield neighbourhood named
OL,4,Aamong coolest in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat makes a modern suburb trendy? Lots
OL,7,Fof places to eat and drink, perhaps? A
OL,8,Fyouthful and vibrant population? Are
OL,9,Flive music venues and good leisure
OL,10,Ffacilities a must?
OL,12,FAfter Crookes, in the west of
OL,13,FSheffield, was named the sixth coolest
OL,14,Fneighbourhood in the UK by Time Out
OL,15,Fmagazine, the BBC spoke to people in
OL,16,Fthe area to find out what they think
OL,17,Fmakes the area so great.
OL,19,FPopular with students and young
OL,20,Ffamilies, Crookes was described by Time
OL,21,FOut as "not flashy or fussy" but
OL,22,Fpacking "a lot of punch for its size."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
