OL,3,GNEWSASheffield neighbourhood named
OL,4,Aamong coolest in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts offering of restaurants, cafes and
OL,7,Fbars was part of the rationale, while
OL,8,Fresidents and business owners said the
OL,9,Fneighbourhood's independent style and
OL,10,Ftight-knit community are what make it
OL,11,Fso "cool".
